@startuml
title BEACON - System Context (C1)

!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Context.puml

Person(admin, "Admin", "Manages probes, plugins, actions, and dashboards")
System(beacon, "BEACON Platform", "Distributed probe management and network observability platform")

System_Ext(targets, "Site Wi-Fi and Network Targets", "Access points, gateways, HTTP targets, and iPerf endpoints measured by probes")
System_Ext(grafanaUsers, "Dashboard Consumers", "Users who view shared Grafana dashboards or embeds")

Rel(admin, beacon, "Registers probes, assigns plugins, configures checks, triggers actions, and opens embeds", "GraphQL + HTTP")
Rel(grafanaUsers, beacon, "Consume monitoring dashboards", "Grafana UI / embeds")
Rel(beacon, targets, "Executes scheduled and on-demand network checks")

note right of beacon
  Main deployables:
  - central-server (.NET 9)
  - probe-agent (Python)
  - monitoring-stack (Prometheus + Grafana)
end note

@enduml
